Description: checker for excessive references in Sphinx documents
 The ‘sphinx_linklint’ extension for Sphinx finds excessive references in
 Sphinx documentation, and can optionally remove the hyperlink from each.
 .
 Examples of excessive references found by this extension:
  * A reference to the same section that contains the reference.
  * Identical references in the same paragraph.

